  "goodToKnow": "Scherzhaft means joking or jocular: eine scherzhafte Bemerkung, scherzhaft gemeint, often in dictionaries to mark playful usage. Der Scherz is a joke: Scherz beiseite (joking aside), Mach keine Scherze! (you're kidding). Scherzen means to joke. Synonyms: spaßhaft, humorvoll, witzig. In music, das Scherzo is a lively movement."
